  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Global initiative to end all Corporal Punishment of Children works to prevent violence against children by promoting a Universal ban on all corporal punishment. The project conducts advocay work in relation to governments, UN and International NGO&apos;s.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">&quot;Global Initiative to end all Corporal Punishment of Children&quot; &#xe4;r ett projekt som verkar f&#xf6;r att skydda barn mot aga genom att fr&#xe4;mja       staters antaganden av lagstiftning som f&#xf6;rbjuder aga. Projektet       bedriver p&#xe5;verkansarbete och samverkar med FN, NGO och stater.</narrative>
  </description>
